{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://nimg.ws.126.net/?src=http%3A%2F%2Fdingyue.ws.126.net%2F2026%2F1111%2F6e4b564bg00tobsuh001qd000tz00e0g.gif&amp;thumbnail=660x2147483647&amp;quality=80&amp;type=gif\">\n</p>\n<p>據介紹，元寶搜索依託元寶大模型能力重構搜索全鏈路，擁有千億級索引，檢索範圍覆蓋全網網頁、公眾號、視頻號以及學術文獻，接入157個權威信源，優先推送官方、權威來源內容。產品將廣告和搜索答案明確區分，廣告單獨標註且支持一鍵收起廣告。</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/1111/51e5341b0cb2ec2.jpg\">\n</p>\n<p>交互層面支持文字、語音、拍照搜索，可直接輸出圖表、卡片式回答，主打AI原生搜索體驗。</p>\n<p>元寶搜索也是騰訊在AI搜索賽道的重要佈局，此前該產品已經以 API 形式面向B端客户開放。</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://nimg.ws.126.net/?src=http%3A%2F%2Fdingyue.ws.126.net%2F2026%2F1111%2F6e4b564bg00tobsuh001qd000tz00e0g.gif&amp;thumbnail=660x2147483647&amp;quality=80&amp;type=gif\">\n</p>\n\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/1111/51e5341b0cb2ec2.jpg\">\n</p>\n\n\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T08:35:00.202522+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":203,"images":4,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T07:53:03+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T02:17:16.902971+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T08:28:25.518156+00:00","content_hash":"388dbb24d28f2ae911c1c259d4cb96a6fef493844fd23ae024774ec01585c747","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}